  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowerment of women and youth in marginalised neighbourhoods of Fes and capacity building for  grassroots CSOs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowerment of women and youth in marginalised neighbourhoods in Fes. Protect women from violence.
Legal knowledge on women&apos;s rights reinforced through complementary legal literacy classes. Enhancement of women&apos;s and youth&apos;s economic independence
Raise men&apos;s awareness of women&apos;s rights.</narrative>
  </description>
